 .                                       51 //!    `INSERT` values. The tenant
 .                                       ..  id used for writes always comes f
 .                                       .. rom the
 .                                       52 //!    scope, never from caller-su
 .                                       .. pplied data.
 .                                       53 //!
 .                                       54 //! 3. **Database constraints** —
 .                                       .. each entity table declares
 .                                       55 //!    `UNIQUE (tenant_id, id)` an
 .                                       .. d foreign keys are *composite* key
 .                                       .. s of the
