153
154 Offizielle Browserquellen: [Chrome: Erweiterung entpackt laden](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/get-started/tutorial/hello-world#load-unpacked), [Firefox: temporär installieren](https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/develop/temporary-installation-in-firefox/), [Firefox: Signierung](https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/publish/signing-and-distribution-overview/).
