3c">2</text><text x="453" y="285" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">Programm starten</text><text x="453" y="325" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Windows: Start HeavenKey.cmd</text><text x="453" y="352" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Mac: Start HeavenKey.command</text><text x="453" y="379" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Linux: ./start.sh</text><rect x="814" y="195" width="356" height="255" rx="12" fill="white" stroke="#d5ddda"/><circle cx="849" cy="230" r="20" fill="#dfc596"/><text x="843" y="237" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">3</text><text x="839" y="285" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">Browser öffnen</text><text x="839" y="325" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">http://localhost:18240</text><text x="839" y="352" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Programm geöffnet lassen.</text><text x="839" y="379" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Die Erweiterung ist optional.</text><rect x="42" y="480" width="1115" height="90" rx="12" fill="#e8eeea" stroke="none"/><text x="65" y="513" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">Neuer 0.7-Quellstand: einfacher Entwicklungsstart</text><text x="65" y="546" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Rust + Bun 1.4.2 + Python installieren → python3 scripts/first_run.py</text><text x="42" y="635" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Bedienillustration · Quellstand 0.7 · keine Browser-Abnahme</text></svg>
