1 <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1200" height="660" viewBox="0 0 1200 660" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc"><title id="title">Deinen ersten Passkey einrichten</title><desc id="desc">Der lokale Einrichtungscode vergibt die Eigentümerrolle genau einmal.. Schematische Bedienillustration.</desc><rect x="0" y="0" width="1200" height="660" rx="0" fill="#f4f4ef" stroke="none"/><rect x="0" y="0" width="1200" height="110" rx="0" fill="#102b37" stroke="none"/><text x="42" y="45" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="600" fill="#dfc596">HeavenKey · Schritt für Schritt</text><text x="42" y="85" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="30" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff">Deinen ersten Passkey einrichten</text><text x="42" y="148" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Der lokale Einrichtungscode vergibt die Eigentümerrolle genau einmal.</text><rect x="42" y="185" width="700" height="365" rx="12" fill="white" stroke="#d5ddda"/><rect x="42" y="185" width="700" height="42" rx="12" fill="#e5e9e6" stroke="none"/><text x="64" y="212" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">http://localhost:18240</text><text x="70" y="265" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">Deine Schlüssel. Begrenzte Rechte.</text><text x="70" y="306" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Name im Labor</text><rect x="70" y="318" width="575" height="42" rx="5" fill="#f4f4ef" stroke="#b9c8c5"/><text x="85" y="345" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">owner</text><text x="70" y="386" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Einrichtungscode · nur für Eigentümer</text><rect x="70" y="398" width="575" height="42" rx="5" fill="#f4f4ef" stroke="#b9c8c5"/><text x=