docs/images/07-agenten.svg --- XML
1 <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1200" height="660" viewBox="0 0 1200 660" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc"><title id="title">Agenten gezielt arbeiten lassen</title><desc id="desc">Befristete Aufgaben mit eigenem Schlüssel und jederzeit widerrufbaren Rechten.. Schematische Bedienillustration.</desc><rect x="0" y="0" width="1200" height="660" rx="0" fill="#f4f4ef" stroke="none"/><rect x="0" y="0" width="1200" height="110" rx="0" fill="#102b37" stroke="none"/><text x="42" y="45" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="600" fill="#dfc596">HeavenKey · Schritt für Schritt</text><text x="42" y="85" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="30" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff">Agenten gezielt arbeiten lassen</text><text x="42" y="148" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Befristete Aufgaben mit eigenem Schlüssel und jederzeit widerrufbaren Rechten.</text><rect x="42" y="195" width="710" height="360" rx="12" fill="white" stroke="#d5ddda"/><text x="70" y="242" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">Agentenauftrag freigeben</text><text x="70" y="288" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Name</text><text x="260" y="288" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Hotel-Assistent</text><text x="70" y="331" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Ziel</text><text x="260" y="331" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">CRM-Beispielkontakt</text><text x="70" y="374" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Rechte</text><text x="260" y="374" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Lesen + Notiz ändern</text><text x="70" y="417" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Gültigkeit</text><text x="260" y="417" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">1800 Sekunden</text><text x="70" y="460" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Identität</text><text x="260" y="460" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Eigener öffentlicher Ed25519-Schlüssel</text><circle cx="802" cy="245" r="20" fill="#dfc596"/><text x="796" y="252" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">1</text><text x="835" y="240" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Lokales Agentenprogramm</text><text x="835" y="267" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">erzeugt seinen eigenen Schlüssel.</text><circle cx="802" cy="350" r="20" fill="#dfc596"/><text x="796" y="357" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">2</text><text x="835" y="345" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Du bestätigst den genauen</text><text x="835" y="372" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Auftrag mit deinem Passkey.</text><circle cx="802" cy="455" r="20" fill="#dfc596"/><text x="796" y="462" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#19323c">3</text><text x="835" y="450" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Jeder Aufruf beweist den</text><text x="835" y="477" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Schlüsselbesitz und prüft Rechte.</text><text x="70" y="596" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="400" fill="#19323c">Der CRM-Pilot nutzt synthetische Daten. Eine reale Next-Office-Anbindung folgt separat.</text><text x="42" y="635" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#52696f">Bedienillustration · Quellstand 0.7 · keine Browser-Abnahme</text></svg>
